{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Moving Letters, the most relaxing, addictive and brain teasing word game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430120/extras/89f2682ca8abb707da5c8bde34e3538b.poster.avif?t=1769787800\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430120/extras/89f2682ca8abb707da5c8bde34e3538b.webm?t=1769787800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430120/extras/89f2682ca8abb707da5c8bde34e3538b.mp4?t=1769787800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen and exercise your mind and discover the most used words in English in Moving Letters, a unique word search. Find the word to advance to the next level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430120/extras/4651a9145b9a3dff8153937df98118bb.poster.avif?t=1769787800\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430120/extras/4651a9145b9a3dff8153937df98118bb.webm?t=1769787800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430120/extras/4651a9145b9a3dff8153937df98118bb.mp4?t=1769787800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy word find games? Try it and You\u2019ll never experience a dull moment after you try this addicting word puzzle game. Play this game once and just you won\u2019t be able to put it down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Logo-tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Secret words HEART = EARTH (only English &amp; relaxation mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 22 wordlists (Hacker language, Esperanto, Polish, English, French, German, Spanish, Romance, Ukrainian, Leet etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leaderboards (live scores and Hall Of Fame)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 31 languages supported (included Esperanto, Belarussian)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mouse control, keyboard or any gamepad (relaxing vibration support)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Image hints and &quot;Reveal answer hint&quot; in &quot;Relaxation Mode&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mega relaxing music and sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Those learning English can practice vocabulary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > People who know English very well (better than me) will also have the challenge in online mode with other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2 modes: Relaxation Mode (single player) and Online mode with other players (cross-platform) or Steam friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Steam cloud</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Small size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All resolution supported (21:9, UltraWide, HyperWide etc.)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hello word!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1430120/cc14c3c0e165568c2ea3f2fed858de1b12fd5524.jpg"},{"name":"Move it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1430120/f501392ba5418784ae759705b7145b3644f59684.jpg"},{"name":"Online","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co